# What never reaches the distribution zip.
#
# build.sh reads this file to build the zip, so the exclusions live in exactly
# one place.
#
# Rules:
#   a line ending in /   a directory, excluded with everything under it
#   anything else        a file name or a glob, matched against the path
#                        relative to the plugin root and against the basename
#   # or blank           ignored

# The suite. It is how the plugin is built, not how it runs.
tests/

# The two working documents.
CLAUDE.md
PLUGIN-SPEC.md

# The build itself.
build.sh
build/
.distignore

# Anything beginning with a dot, at any depth. Covers .git, .gitignore,
# .github, .DS_Store, .idea, .vscode and everything like them.
.*

# Dependency and tooling directories, in case any ever appear.
node_modules/
vendor/

# Editor and operating system leftovers.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
*.tmp
*~
Thumbs.db

# Build output and archives.
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.log
*.sql
